WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.870
Northern Rakhine State, in Myanmar.

2
00:00:02.920 --> 00:00:07.230
Just across the border lies Cox's
Bazar District, in Bangladesh.

3
00:00:07.280 --> 00:00:12.490
From 2017, hundreds of thousands of
Rohingya people crossed this one border,

4
00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:14.190
within a year.

5
00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:17.690
Why would so many people
leave in so short a time?

6
00:00:17.740 --> 00:00:19.150
Did they move for work?

7
00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:20.970
And who looks after them now?

8
00:00:21.020 --> 00:00:24.830
In this mission, you'll sort the push
and pull factors behind the move,

9
00:00:24.880 --> 00:00:27.830
on a map of origin and destination.

10
00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:30.370
Then you'll weigh the
impacts on the migrants,

11
00:00:30.420 --> 00:00:33.490
the place they left, and
the place they reached.

12
00:00:33.540 --> 00:00:37.110
Your mission: explain why the
Rohingya crossed into Bangladesh,

13
00:00:37.160 --> 00:00:40.050
and find out who supports them today.
